  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="228f43a7-9c15-56bd-8e7d-dda90c21efe2" activityNameId="01d20d3a-530b-587f-8151-cd6b7ced2ef9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gold, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gold, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery
This multi-output process 'mining and refining, gold-silver deposit' delivers the two co-products 'gold, from combined gold-silver-production, at refinery' and 'silver, from combined gold-silver-production, at refinery'. This data set includes the mining in Papua New Guinea in open pit mines incl. land use.  Air emissions are estimated.;
UUID: 81de3381-4e7a-34f3-8e50-68715fffd8d6
This data set includes the combined mining and refining of gold and silver in open pit mines in Papua New Guinea incl. energy and material use, water and air emissions of metals and land use.
Location: Material requirements are estimated with Australian data, Air emissions are estimated with Swedish data.
Technology: Refinement is estimated with electrolysis-data.
Time period: Period of two public environmental report
Production volume: 23.57 t gold and 24 t silver per year
Sampling: environmental report of one mine in the year 2000 and one mine in 2006 
Extrapolations: Emissions to water are calculated with older data of one mine
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_81de3381-4e7a-34f3-8e50-68715fffd8d6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="d401b69d-20b0-5047-adef-4998d5a7192f" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
